    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "08. Command Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "08.00",
    "summary": "The phase runs in 5 steps:\n\n1. [Start of Command Phase](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-command-phase): resolve start-of-phase rules.\n2. [Gain Core CP](vsdata:core-rule/gain-core-cp): each player gains 1CP.\n3. [Battle-Shock Step](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock-step): you assess your forces’ combat readiness with Battle-shock rolls.\n4. Command Abilities: you use any abilities that work in this phase.\n5. [End of Command Phase](vsdata:core-rule/end-of-command-phase): resolve end-of-phase rules.",
